{
  "name": "08 – Envoi depuis le CRM (OVH)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📤 08 – Envoi depuis le CRM\n\nQuand tu cliques **Envoyer** dans le CRM, le CRM appelle ce webhook et l'email part de **contact@solvelab.fr** (SMTP).\n\nProduction URL du nœud 1 → Vercel, variable `N8N_MAIL_WEBHOOK_URL`.\n\nFilet de sécurité : lun-ven, toutes les heures, il renvoie les emails restés en attente.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        -420
      ],
      "id": "97534dff-3419-43b7-ba0c-b19db9bc5653",
      "name": "Note -520--420"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔑 Connexions\n- **CRM x-api-key** : nœuds 1, 2 et les deux « CRM »\n- **SMTP** : nœud « Envoyer »",
        "height": 170,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        -420
      ],
      "id": "2bfc2dc2-877b-480c-81b1-4600adbeb925",
      "name": "Note 440--420"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "crm-envoi-email",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -520,
        0
      ],
      "id": "456c2ceb-f1a7-4fae-b33d-ca360dc80487",
      "name": "1. Ordre du CRM (webhook)",
      "webhookId": "597f4705-49a4-4403-ab67-9cf02596fe8d",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "a-choisir",
          "name": "CRM x-api-key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8-19 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -520,
        220
      ],
      "id": "86352831-5fca-4ce1-bc0a-e78ef8f4b079",
      "name": "Toutes les heures (lun-ven)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://crm-prospection-eight.vercel.app/api/n8n/messages?send_status=a_envoyer&direction=sortant&limit=20",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -300,
        220
      ],
      "id": "d736c941-4b05-44a4-8c3f-8f07943d9a27",
      "name": "2. Emails en attente (CRM)",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "a-choisir",
          "name": "CRM x-api-key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Ordre reçu du CRM : on garde seulement ce qui sert à l'envoi.\nconst b = $json.body ?? {};\nif (b.action !== 'envoyer_email') return [];\nreturn [{ json: {\n  message_id: b.message_id, to: b.to, subject: b.subject || '(sans objet)', body: b.body || '',\n  thread_id: b.thread_id || null,\n} }];\n"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -300,
        0
      ],
      "id": "1130e67e-1b2c-42a6-aaf0-f4e7880eecff",
      "name": "Lire l'ordre"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Filet de sécurité : emails écrits dans le CRM depuis plus de 10 min et pas encore partis.\nconst limit = Date.now() - 10 * 60 * 1000;\nreturn ($json.messages ?? [])\n  .filter((m) => m.direction === 'sortant' && new Date(m.created_at).getTime() < limit)\n  .map((m) => ({ json: {\n    message_id: m.id, to: m.to_email, subject: m.subject || '(sans objet)', body: m.body || '',\n    thread_id: m.thread_id || null,\n  } }));\n"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -80,
        220
      ],
      "id": "63756d74-02e5-40c7-83e9-ba6a7f8c4f18",
      "name": "Garder les oubliés"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "return { json: $json };"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        140,
        100
      ],
      "id": "76852b4a-96f6-441d-8199-c4fc12a35f5b",
      "name": "Email à envoyer"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "=https://crm-prospection-eight.vercel.app/api/n8n/messages/{{ $('Email à envoyer').item.json.message_id }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ send_status: 'envoye', external_id: $json.messageId, thread_id: $('Email à envoyer').item.json.thread_id || $json.messageId }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        860,
        40
      ],
      "id": "a2cc09b3-91f2-494e-83a9-62bc1e102f50",
      "name": "CRM : envoyé ✓",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "a-choisir",
          "name": "CRM x-api-key"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "=https://crm-prospection-eight.vercel.app/api/n8n/messages/{{ $('Email à envoyer').item.json.message_id }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ send_status: 'erreur', error: String($json.error?.message ?? $json.error ?? 'Envoi Gmail impossible') }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        860,
        260
      ],
      "id": "1705f7e1-260d-436d-bd27-eb4518419188",
      "name": "CRM : erreur",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "a-choisir",
          "name": "CRM x-api-key"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "email",
        "operation": "send",
        "fromEmail": "Nolla – SolveLab <contact@solvelab.fr>",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.to }}",
        "subject": "={{ $json.subject }}",
        "emailFormat": "text",
        "text": "={{ $json.body }}",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1000,
        120
      ],
      "id": "6640adfb-4e60-40a9-8b9e-83fb22201982",
      "name": "Envoyer (OVH, SMTP)",
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "a-choisir",
          "name": "SMTP"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    }
  ],
